{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_14_title", "source_sha256": "6208eb8d2154c691bdf2bc37509d78d14fa42a16c97bab3e549fd5b195ecc946", "ja": "そして、また", "zh": "然后，再次", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_14_synopsis", "source_sha256": "718728f1c2ed0bfaa7c504b9fb1e387fd0058e8d60cedae385c2588c57199358", "ja": "記念公演が幕を閉じた。閑散とした会場を、\nカメラ越しに眺めるプロデューサー。ライブ\nの余韻を噛みしめつつ、その瞳は先を見据え\nて……最後に社長、美咲、小鳥達を映して、\n映像は暗転するのだった。", "zh": "纪念公演落下帷幕。制作人透过镜头，凝视着冷清下来的会场。他细细回味着演唱会的余韵，目光却已望向远方……最后，画面定格在社长、美咲和小鸟身上，随即转入黑暗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_14_1000_null", "source_sha256": "81d2b9fb3922304b523f04def4959f5ed8bda64de73e3b1cc098f03ef12a2e86", "ja": "記念ライブ、全日程が終了した。\nあれだけ賑やかだった会場が、今はひどく静かで……。", "zh": "纪念演唱会的全部场次都结束了。\n那么热闹的会场，现在却静得出奇……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_14_1001_president", "source_sha256": "68662cc48217577377b2768ba52a1bbed3858b790f13ab2ac863eeef113198d1", "ja": "いやあ、終わってしまったね。楽しい時間ほど\n早く過ぎると言うが、まさに一瞬のようだったよ。", "zh": "哎呀，这就结束了呢。虽说快乐的时光总是\n过得飞快，但刚才真就宛如一瞬间一样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_14_1002_101kot", "source_sha256": "92ff45324412b36629986354764a37160e7d5c1bc2f2bf321e5118625b8e7eb5", "ja": "本当に……本当に、素敵なライブでしたね！\nこうして関わる事ができて、感無量です、うぅ……！", "zh": "真的……真的是一场精彩绝伦的演出呢！\n能够以这样的方式参与其中，我真是感慨万千，呜呜……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_14_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "9810758961325d6cb296bae1446d3bc14530537004c442537f10fb44862920ad", "ja": "ライブが終わる時、いつも思うんですけど……。\nなんだかちょっと寂しいですね。ぐすっ。", "zh": "每次演唱会结束的时候，我总会想……  \n总觉得有点寂寞呢。抽泣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_14_1004_president", "source_sha256": "235f672a0f27519a759bb513e5ece87153afadfb75a277abcd5015f958a9a670", "ja": "うむ……だが、寂しがっている暇はない！\nまだまだ仕事は山積みなのだから。", "zh": "唔……但是，可没有时间感到寂寞！\n毕竟工作还堆积如山呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_14_1005_president", "source_sha256": "38ed04c2702da574741a77d494c9548c12c8b2a609969ef33c4a76dff1e52f6b", "ja": "節目節目の足跡をしっかり残しつつ、\n私達は前へと、進んでいかなければならないんだ。", "zh": "在每个重要节点都留下清晰的足迹，同时，我们也必须继续向前迈进。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_14_1006_101kot", "source_sha256": "e3cb8c49d8a1afd3aa80f04e3f8f37a0e17b06e0687179f5736124d85d2cf434", "ja": "そうですね……！　そうして進んでいった先で、\nまた全員揃って、節目の日を迎えられたらいいですね。", "zh": "是啊……！希望我们这样一路前进，在前方再次全员到齐，共同迎来值得纪念的日子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_14_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "43695a72120b2ddda35c17df6e64fb361e9426a0d004b390445e27a36d9a52ef", "ja": "次はどんな衣装になるのかな～？\n今から考えておきますね♪", "zh": "下次会是什么样的服装呢～？\n我现在就先想想吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_14_1008_null", "source_sha256": "ac149f36cf25bde66c6cc6503073f1ade35ccbf21cf5ccedb688603f07e88034", "ja": "みなさんにもお尋ねします。\nアイドル達の、かけがえのない『輝き』とは？", "zh": "也想问问大家。\n偶像们无可替代的“光辉”是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_14_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "6f84482f524c266d96d507c9466ab90d2c9912ff1a66dd72390c099696df213a", "ja": "それは……ふふふ♪\nみんな、とーっても仲が良いところだと思います！", "zh": "那个……呵呵呵♪\n我觉得，就是大家关系特别好这一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_14_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "d67554714c487f57313d0964598fb9e7a8736bd00b54bf1e243fc9ceddc58590", "ja": "ひとりだと挫けちゃいそうな時でも、みんなで乗り\n越えていくところを、何度も、何度も見てましたから！", "zh": "即使是一个人快要坚持不下去的时候，大家也会一起克服难关，这样的场景我已经看过一次又一次了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_14_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "0bf8339a40536d30d000fabb81f16af137116cd4914da638df7bc551120bd657", "ja": "私は、そうですね……それぞれ個性的なところかしら？\nバラバラだけど、全員素敵な女の子達です♪", "zh": "我想，应该是……大家各有各的个性吧？\n虽然各不相同，但全都是很棒的女孩子♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_14_1012_101kot", "source_sha256": "09e7be20445240de8aee67dd5d653fa6e6e0cf22b426f9bd94df7c8bf0ac1e0a", "ja": "私、ずーっとみんなを見守ってきましたから、すっかり\nお母さんのような気持ちになってしまって……。", "zh": "我一直守护着大家，不知不觉间，竟然有了一种像妈妈一样的心情……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_14_1013_101kot", "source_sha256": "b7d06f75222617b90316d062de3c3d88f568eb52cb1df4a8aed5a08a68256319", "ja": "そんな年齢じゃないのに、おかしいですよね。\nうふふっ♪", "zh": "明明还没到那个年纪，却有这种感觉，真奇怪呢。\n呜呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_14_1014_president", "source_sha256": "f013ba95dca94666527816013fd5667ac916e1c076cf1f97f0569d22e66a869f", "ja": "それなら私は、君のプロデュースによって、\nアイドル達が活躍しているところ、と答えよう！", "zh": "那我就回答：偶像们正通过你的制作活跃着！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_14_1015_president", "source_sha256": "af923c7c560cec031aa61b9713372705a81ee0b2dd0d9373407273e69fcb9272", "ja": "君の手腕如何によって、アイドル達は\n困難を乗り越え、個性を輝かせていくのだからね。", "zh": "偶像们能否克服困难、绽放个性，\n可全都取决于你的手腕了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_14_1016_president", "source_sha256": "a027b8148e0a9592f827b0a608c56aa6818a8987f586f5f505d88426a1dfb162", "ja": "というわけで、ひとつ……\nこれからも、プロデュースよろしく頼むよ、君！！", "zh": "所以，有件事……今后也要拜托你继续负责制作了，君！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_14_1017_101kot", "source_sha256": "fbff7614d8437bac35d06abb952a9d8755306a4237e923652bcc8a8aaecc9fa6", "ja": "……っと、これで荷物は全部ですね。\n{$P$}さん、早く早く♪", "zh": "……好了，这样行李就全都齐了。\n{$P$}先生，快点快点♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_14_1018_102mis", "source_sha256": "caa96cc5e32d4035f9236ba11d397574c650d864c8e9aa4cb9e05be1bca387a8", "ja": "私達の劇場に帰りましょう！\nアイドルのみんなも、待ってますからね～。えへへ。", "zh": "回到我们的剧场吧！偶像们也都在等着呢～。嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_14_1019_p", "source_sha256": "11e728b745af3142bb0c8d0e8630e2a1431533d6c44d448b4d017fb8c24a035d", "ja": "あ、待ってください、今行きます！\nカメラを止めて……っと。", "zh": "啊，请等一下，我这就来！\n先把摄像机关掉……好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0241_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0241_story_14_2020_null", "source_sha256": "7f63c65d50c13870fce8bfff84acbd5bb86874f31e725fc65e2b8d5906913820", "ja": "……プツン。", "zh": "……嘟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
